<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="arch-l7" name="Kien-truc-thuc-te"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1100" pageHeight="930" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Kiến trúc đã hiện thực của hệ thống L7&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="900" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2b6a9a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;1 · TRÌNH BÀY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;dashboard/app.py (Streamlit: 3 khung, form tạo hồ sơ mới) · src/ui/error_view.py&lt;br&gt;Không chứa quy tắc nghiệp vụ" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#e8f0f8;strokeColor=#2b6a9a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="900" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2650a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;2 · NGHIỆP VỤ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;transform/rules.py · clean_customers.py · dedupe.py · intake.py · merge_rules.py&lt;br&gt;quality/checks.py (DQ01–DQ06) · pipeline.py (điều phối, CLI)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Hàm thuần: không đọc ghi CSDL hoặc tệp&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#fdf0dc;strokeColor=#c2650a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="900" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1b9467&quot; style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;3 · TRUY CẬP DỮ LIỆU&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;extract/read_source.py (đọc CSV) · load/loader.py (upsert, SCD loại 2)&lt;br&gt;load/customer_repo.py (gộp, tạo hồ sơ) · report/queries.py (chỉ đọc) · db.py&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Đọc/ghi dữ liệu, che giấu SQLAlchemy và PostgreSQL&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#e1f4ea;strokeColor=#1b9467;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="900" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2b3a4a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;4 · LƯU TRỮ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;PostgreSQL 16 (sql/*.sql): stg · core (customer_clean, reject_customer, duplicate_review, merge_log)&lt;br&gt;dwh (4 dim + 2 fact) · view_customer_masked (che số điện thoại) · customers_raw.csv (chỉ đọc)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#eff1f4;strokeColor=#2b3a4a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="630" width="900" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;NGOÀI PHẠM VI (WON'T):&lt;/b&gt; đăng nhập thật (SSO) · Airflow / triển khai đám mây · đối sánh mờ bằng học máy · đồng bộ ngược về nguồn · dữ liệu đơn hàng và bảo hành" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#fdecea;strokeColor=#8b1a1a;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#8b1a1a;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="785" width="900" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="gọi hàm" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#e07b1a;strokeWidth=3;endSize=8;exitX=0.2;exitY=1;entryX=0.2;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCel